# DEPRECATED — Modular Cursor Rules

Project rules moved to Progressive Disclosure under:

`.cursor/rules/`

- `ssb-core.mdc` — always apply
- `ssb-storefront.mdc` — storefront globs
- `ssb-admin.mdc` — admin globs
- `ssb-perf-a11y.mdc` — app/services globs

Do not duplicate guidance here. Edit the `.mdc` files instead.
If Cursor still loads this file, treat it as a pointer only.
